src/
├── layer1/   — Teensy 4.0 — light ring sensing + line detection
│               Reads 32 LDR sensors via MUX, runs findLine(), transmits
│               results (lineDetected, angle, size) to layer2 over Serial.
│               Libraries: light_ring, angle_utils, serial_comm
│
├── layer2/   — Teensy 4.0 — locomotion + game logic
│               Receives line data from layer1, reads IMU, drives X-drive
│               motors with yaw heading-hold PID, controls dribbler and kicker.
│               Libraries: movement, scoring, layer1_comm, serial_comm
│
└── layer3/   — Seeed XIAO ESP32-C3 — camera / wireless
                ESP-NOW peer-to-peer link. Handles camera input or
                inter-board communication (role auto-detected at boot).
